# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in real values.
# Nothing here is required to run the app — every rail falls back to an
# honest simulator without it. See docs/pollar-integration.md.

# Real Pollar testnet API key (docs.pollar.xyz dashboard -> API keys ->
# testnet). Without this, @mova/settlement-pollar always reports
# capability "MOCK" and never touches the network — see
# packages/settlement/pollar/src/pollarClient.ts. Setting this alone does
# NOT make it real: this build has no @pollar/core wiring yet (see
# docs/open-questions.md) — that's the next integration step, not a
# config flag.
POLLAR_API_KEY=
